      "Second, live with both feet in the Story. The world will offer you a thousand other stories: nationalism, consumerism, sexual self-discovery, social activism, personal brand-building, family idolatry. Each story will try to claim ultimate ground. But you know the real Story. Live in it. Marry, work, suffer, give, vote, parent, fast, pray, evangelize, rest — all as someone who knows where the universe is going. This makes a Christian neither escapist nor utopian; it makes them strangely free.",
